      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im losing it lol. every single time i try to get active in a new discord or a subreddit, something happens. like, within like 2 days of me joining, the whole chat just goes dead or i get \"accidentally\" muted for no reason. i've tried 5 different groups this month and it's happened in all of them. is it possible the algos do this? like if your profile is flagged for some reason?",
